## Reference

`guide_decider.py`: `build_guide_questions`, `parse_guide_decision`, `decide_guide_turn`, `noul_true` / `noul_false`. Heuristics stay and win when Jev is off, unsure, or down. Explicit safety checks stay authoritative over a Jev yes.
